    {
      "fileName": "thaumaturges-demesne.json",
      "id": "rHV8GUqqt8WLgTJp",
      "name": "Thaumaturge's Demesne",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "rHV8GUqqt8WLgTJp",
        "folder": "Z1ffyKBWBwxc4elj",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Thaumaturge's Demesne",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have claimed an area or location as your demesne, granting you the ability to ward and protect it. When you select this feat, choose a demesne, an area of no more than 2,000 square feet. You must legitimately own the area or, if its a public area, you must lay claim to the area without anyone contesting it.</p>\n<p>Once you've chosen your demesne, it's automatically protected by an arcane @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Peaceful Bubble] spell with an unlimited duration, heightened to half your level rounded up and using your thaumaturge class DC in place of a spell DC, if necessary. Additionally, the demesne is attended by three unseen custodians, as a successful @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal Custodians]{Unseen Custodians} ritual, and one object in the area gains an elemental sentinel, as a successful @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Elemental Sentinel] ritual.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 12
          },
